HBO has revealed more of the cast for its Harry Potter series.

In season one, viewers will see—or hear:

• Leo Bill (Alice in Wonderland) as Nearly Headless Nick;
• Andrew Brooke (The Agency) as the Bloody Baron;
• Laura Smyth (Baby Reindeer) as the Fat Lady;
• Daniel Fearn (Slow Horses) as the Fat Friar;
• David Threlfall (Shameless) as the voice of the Sorting Hat.

The series is set to premiere on December 25.

